    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "liwei",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "liwei",
      "text": "Stand, run, climb. Tao only wanted my eyes, not my legs."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "liwei",
      "text": "My name is Li Wei. I was a scout, until Tao caged me and made me draw every pass in these mountains."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "liwei",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "bashir",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "bashir",
      "text": "He caged a mapmaker? Then he feared what you knew."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "bashir",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "liwei",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "liwei",
      "text": "He feared that I would sell it. So he locked it in a bamboo box, with me inside."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "liwei",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "hero",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "text": "We march on the Great Wall. Tao and the Iron Hand wait behind it."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "hero",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "liwei",
      "pose": "point"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "liwei",
      "text": "Then you need me. I have walked every mile of it, General. I know where it cracks."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "liwei",
      "text": "Every loose stone, every gate hung too heavy, every tower built in a hurry. I drew them all for Tao."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "liwei",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "roxana",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "roxana",
      "text": "Show me the cracks, Li Wei, and I will show you what my powder does to them."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "roxana",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "titus",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "titus",
      "text": "Quick feet and sharp eyes. We lost a friend who had both. It is good to have them in the company again."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "titus",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "liwei",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "liwei",
      "text": "Then let Tao learn what his maps are worth in the wrong hands."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "liwei",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "hero",
      "pose": "point"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "text": "Welcome to the company, Li Wei. Lead us to the Wall."
    },
